# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — setuid 投递型包在 OHOS 的安装四重墙与运行期不触发 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-10-08
# Software: dma 0.14（一切 setuid/setgid 投递型 MTA/助手：dma、nullmailer、ssmtp 同族）
# Gate: make install（上游）/ package() 与 test_package（我方）
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

id:                     E3237
title: setuid 投递型包在 OHOS 的四重安装墙（install 命令缺失/非 root/mail 组不存在/setuid-setgid 位被剥离）叠加 /var ENOENT 与 /etc 只读、非 root 运行期不进入 setuid 降权块 —— 处置=编译照交 + self.copy 自装 + 消费者断言只打参数期 + 能力面逐字披露
trigger_tool: make|install|chmod|chgrp|setuid
phase: packaging|installation
error_signature: install: command not found|No such file or directory.*install|KeyError.*getgrnam.*mail|setuid=False|setgid=False|/var.*ENOENT|Read-only file system.*etc|cannot drop root privileges
severity:               2
category:               hmdfs, ohos, packaging, security, capabilities
match_keywords: setuid, setgid, setgid bit, install -m 4754, install -m 2755,
  -o root, -g mail, getgrnam, chgrp, mail group, /var/spool, /var/queue,
  drop root privileges, geteuid, setuid(), dma, dma-mbox-create, MTA,
  delivery path, EX_USAGE, appres mode, ddccontrol mode
root_cause: 上游按 BSD/Linux root+mail 组 + setuid/setgid 特权投递模型设计安装与运行路径；
  OHOS/HarmonyOS PC 是无 root 应用沙箱 + HMDFS 文件系统，既不提供 install/chgrp 命令与 mail 组，
  也不保留 setuid/setgid 位，且 /var 不存在、/etc 只读 —— 权限模型与上游假设根本不重合。
affected_scope: 所有以 setuid/setgid 方式安装助手二进制、依赖 /var spool 与 root 运行的
  投递型/守护型上游（MTA、mailbox 创建器、系统助手类）在 OHOS 的安装与运行期
verification_cmd: command -v install; id; python3 -c "import grp;print(grp.getgrnam('mail'))";
  sh -c 'touch <tmp>; chmod u+s <tmp>; python3 -c "import os,stat;s=os.stat(\"<tmp>\");print(oct(s.st_mode),bool(s.st_mode&stat.S_ISUID))"';
  python3 -c "import os;os.stat('/var')" ; python3 -c "import os;os.stat('/etc/dma.conf')"
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: appres-ddccontrol-mode-disclosure-with-copy-install-and-argument-stage-assertions
rec_description: 能力墙属平台事实而非配方缺陷 —— 编译照交；package() 用 self.copy 自装并
  os.chmod(0o755)；消费者断言只选参数期（EX_USAGE、早于 parse_conf）路径；能力面四重墙与
  errno 读数在 notes.md/manifest/PR 补充说明三处逐字披露；⛔ 不改上游 Makefile、不 mock。
rec_command: copy(self, "dma", src=self.source_folder, dst=bindir, keep_path=False)
  # test_package: dma -Z → invalid argument + EX_USAGE(64)
  # test_package: dma -bp -q → 参数期互斥护栏 + EX_USAGE(64)
source_pr: dma 0.14 适配
rec_auto_fix:               false
rec_impl:               manual
last_updated:               2026-10-19
authors:               unknown
doc_file:               doc/E3237.md
